.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-PROBE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-probe , rgoprobe
.Nd send Reticulum probe packets and report RTT
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm probe
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Op Fl s Ar size
.Op Fl t Ar seconds
.Op Fl w Ar seconds
.Op Fl n Ar count
.Op Fl v
.Ar full_name destination_hash
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Sends encrypted probe packets to a destination and prints round-trip timing.
.Ar destination_hash
must be 32 hex characters (16 bytes).
.Sh FLAG PARSING
Flags may appear before, between, or after positional arguments. A literal
.Cm --
ends flag parsing. The
.Fl config
option accepts a config file or a directory. A directory uses the file named
config inside it.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
